SUMMARY:🎷 Jazz Night @ Junction Underground! 🎷
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🎷 **
 Jazz Night @ Junction Underground!** 🎷\n\nSlip into something smooth an
 d join us for a night of *live jazz\, soulful vocals\, and good company* a
 t one of the Junction’s coolest hidden gems — **Junction Underground**
 .\n\nWe’ll be treated to some *incredible up-and-coming jazz performers*
 \, each bringing their own flavour of swing\, blues\, and smoky charm to t
 he stage. And yes — **I’ll be singing too!** Think torch songs\, scatt
 ing\, and a whole lot of sass.\n\nLet's time we had this evenr members had
  a great time!\n\n✨ Expect:\n\n* **Cool sounds. Cool cats. Cooler vibes.
 **\n* A cozy\, speakeasy-style venue.\n* A chance to meet fun\, music-lovi
 ng people (single\, social\, or just jazz-curious).\n* That feeling of *
 “I can’t believe this is only $10.”*\n\n🎶 **Event Details**\n🕢
  Meetup Time: 7:45 PM\n🚪 Doors Open: 8:00 PM\n🎤 Show Starts: 8:30 PM
 \n⏱️ Run Time: 3 hours 30mins (with a chill intermission)\n💸 Cost: 
 **$15 plus fees.** – Don’t wait\, tickets are limited\nTickets - [CLIC
 K HERE ](https://www.centrestageexperience.com/event-details/july-9th-jazz
 -night-1?utm_campaign=065c2b2c-6f38-454f-9ead-8ab62d50d5d0&utm_source=so&u
 tm_medium=mail&cid=3544991e-0eab-4e5e-8800-76ac24b2e639)\n\n📍 Venue: **
 Junction Underground** (details below)\n\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group:*
 *[ Click here to join](https://chat.whatsapp.com/DRFTkxRlHS4B3IL1lMleUd)\n
 \n**Please note:** Seating is limited — it’s part of the intimate vibe
  — so you might need to stand (and sway).\n\nThis is a *laid-back perfor
 mance*\, perfect for music lovers\, first dates\, or anyone who wants to u
 nwind midweek with great tunes and great people.\n\n💬 I’ll be inside 
