SUMMARY:🚌🔒 KINGSTON PENITENTIARY DAY TRIP: PRISON TOUR\, WATERFRONT 
 & DINNER 🔒🚌
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🚌
 🔒 KINGSTON PENITENTIARY DAY TRIP: PRISON TOUR\, WATERFRONT & DINNER 
 🔒🚌\n\nA Full-Day Adventure Outside the City\nThis is one of our **bi
 gger trips** — and one of the most unique.\n\nWe’re heading to Kingsto
 n to visit the iconic Kingston Penitentiary — one of Canada’s most his
 toric and well-known prisons.\n\nOpened in 1835\, this former maximum-secu
 rity prison housed some of the country’s most notorious inmates and oper
 ated for over 180 years. Today\, it’s one of the most fascinating behind
 -the-scenes tours you can experience.\n\nExpect:\n\n🔒 Real prison range
 s and cells\n📖 Stories of inmates and guards\n🚶 A guided tour throug
 h a piece of Canadian history\nAnd we’ll make a full day of it — with 
 time to explore Kingston\, enjoy the waterfront\, and grab dinner together
 .\n\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group:**[ Click here to join](https://chat.w
 hatsapp.com/DRFTkxRlHS4B3IL1lMleUd)\n\n***\n\n🚆 TRAVEL PLAN (PLEASE REA
 D CAREFULLY)\n\nWe will be traveling **together as a group**.\n\n📍 Meet
  in front of the Fairmont Royal York and I will be wearing my Moose Hat.\n
 (This entrance is facing Front Street and not the side entrance.)\n⏰ Mee
 tup Time: **8:15 AM**\n🚶 We leave at **8:30 AM sharp** to walk to the b
 us terminal\n🚌 Bus Departure: **9:00 AM (promptly)**\n📍 Arrival in K
 ingston: Approx. **12:00 PM**\n⚠️ I will only wait until 8:30 AM.\n\nI
 f you miss us\, you miss the trip.\n\n***\n\n🎟️ REQUIRED BEFORE SIGNI
 NG UP\n\nTo join this event\, you MUST purchase BOTH:\n\n1️⃣ 🚌 **Ro
 und-trip bus ticket (Megabus)**\n– Prices start around $10 each way (app
 rox. $20 total\, may increase)\nMake sure you market it as a around trip.\
 nToronto to Kingston\nKingston to Toronto\n**Buy your ticket for this time
  - 9:00am**\n**Return Ticket** **Buy your ticket for this time - 8:40pm** 
 (As of now tickets are 4.99)\n[ CLICK HERE FOR TICKET! ](https://ca.megabu
 s.com/)\n\n2️⃣ 🔒 **Kingston Penitentiary Tour Ticket**\n– Book th
 e **2:20 PM tour**\n– Cost: approx. **$42 with tax**\n– Limited to **2
 5 spots total**\n[Click KERE FOR TICKET!](https://explore.parks.on.ca/book
 ?inventoryGroup=1966980248&startDate=2026-06-13&inventory=1781211015&carAr
 rivalTime=14.2&reservationType=213&screen=0&selectedDiscountGroup=slpc_day
 _visitor&&sid=)\n\n👉 If tickets are sold out\, you cannot join the even
 t.\n\n⚠️ Only those traveling on the SAME bus with the group will be a
 ble to participate.\nWe will not be meeting people in Kingston.\n\n***\n\n
 🚶‍♂️ WHAT WE’LL DO\n\nOnce we arrive in Kingston\, we may:\n\n
 ✔️ Take a short local bus ride (bring at least $4 cash)\n✔️ Explor
 e the area briefly\n✔️ Head to the penitentiary for our scheduled tour
 \n\nAfter the tour:\n\n🌊 Optional walk along the waterfront\n🍔 Dinne
 r at Chuck's Roadhouse Bar & Grill\n🚌 Return bus: Around **8:00 PM** (T
 BC — I’ll confirm)\n\n***\n\n⚠️ EXPECTATIONS\n\nThis is a **struct
 ured group trip**\, not a drop-in event.\n\n✔️ You must be on time\n
 ✔️ You must have all tickets purchased in advance\n✔️ You should b
 e comfortable with a full day of walking and travel\n\nThis helps keep the
  day smooth\, stress-free\, and enjoyable for everyone.\n\n***\n\n🧢 Mee
 tup Details\n📍 Meeting Spot: In front of the Fairmont Royal York\n🫎 
 I’ll be wearing my Moose Hat\n\n***\n\n🎟️ Meetup Fee: $5 cash in pe
 rson or e-transfer to\n📧 **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**\n\nThis helps su
 pport the group and allows us to keep organizing trips like this. 💖\n\n
 ***\n\n🎒 What to Bring\n\nBus tickets (digital or printed)\nPenitentiar
 y ticket\nAt least $4 cash for local transit\nWater & snacks\nComfortable 
 walking shoes\nMoney for dinner\n\n***\n\n🌈 Who Is This For?\n\nThis gr
 oup is open to anyone who wants to be social and make friends — whether 
 single or not.\n\nWe also host:\n🎬 Movies\n🚶 Walks & hikes\n🎭 Art
 s & culture outings\n🍽️ Restaurant gatherings\nThere’s always somet
 hing happening.\n\n***\n\nREMEMBER: You’re welcome to join if you’re r
 eady — but this trip requires planning. Please make sure all tickets are
  secured before signing up.\nAnd as always\, sometimes plans shift — kee
 p an eye on updates.\n\n***\n\n👤 Organizer: Mathew\nQuestions? Post on 
 the event wall or email\n📧 torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com\n\nCome 
 for the prison tour. Stay for the adventure.\nLeave with a story you defin
 itely didn’t expect to tell. 🔒✨
