SUMMARY:🦫⚽ THE GREAT BEAVER QUEST! ⚽🦫
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🦫
 ⚽ THE GREAT BEAVER QUEST! ⚽🦫\n\n### Hunt for 52 Giant Beavers Acros
 s Downtown Toronto!\n\nThe FIFA World Cup is coming to Toronto\, and the c
 ity is celebrating in a uniquely Canadian way... with **52 giant beaver sc
 ulptures** hidden throughout the downtown core!\n\nJoin us for **The Great
  Beaver Quest**\, a fun and social walking adventure as we try to find as 
 many of these public art installations as possible.\n\nWe'll explore parts
  of downtown Toronto\, take photos\, compare discoveries\, and see how man
 y beavers we can track down together.\n\nWhether you're a huge soccer fan\
 , a casual fan\, or someone who couldn't tell a corner kick from a corner 
 store\, this is a fun way to be part of the World Cup excitement while exp
 loring the city and meeting new people.\n\nThis is not a race and there ar
 e no prizes (other than bragging rights 🦫)\, but we'll do our best to f
 ind as many beavers as possible during our adventure.\n\nAfter the walk\, 
 we'll head over to **St. Lawrence Market** for lunch where we can relax\, 
 chat\, and compare our favourite beaver sightings.\n\n📲 **Join Our What
 sApp Group:** [Click here to join](http:/#)\n\n***\n\n## Meetup Details\n\
 n📍 **Meetup Location:** Outside the Elgin & Winter Garden Theatres\n
 🫎 **Look for the Moose Hat!**\n⏰ **Meetup Time:** 11:00am\n⏰ **I wi
 ll only wait 5 minutes.**\n🚶 **Please be prepared to walk.** This is no
 t a difficult walk\, but we will be covering a fair amount of distance ove
 r approximately 2 hours as we search for the beavers.\n💰 **Meetup Fee:*
 * $5 cash in person or E-transfer\n📧 mathewmaclean@hotmail.com\n🏁 **
 Ending Spot:** St. Lawrence Market\n📱 **Beaver Quest App:** [Click Here
 !](https://oldtowntoronto.ca/beaverquest/)\n\n***\n\n## What To Expect\n\n
 🦫 Hunt for as many of the 52 giant beavers as we can find\n📸 Lots of
  photo opportunities\n🚶 A fun downtown walking adventure\n🤝 Meet new
  people and socialize\n⚽ A unique way to experience Toronto's World Cup 
 celebrations\n🍴 Lunch afterward at St. Lawrence\n\nMarket for anyone wh
 o would like to join us\n\n***\n\n## What To Bring\n\n💧 Water\n👟 Goo
 d walking shoes\n📱 A fully charged phone for photos and the app\n🧢 W
 eather-appropriate clothing\n\n***\n\nREMEMBER YOU CAN JUST SHOW UP OR SIG
 N UP ON THE DAY IF YOU ARE NOT SURE YOU CAN MAKE IT.\nTHIS GROUP IS OPEN T
 O THOSE THAT WANT TO BE SOCIAL\, MAKE FRIENDS\, WHETHER YOU ARE SINGLE OR 
 NOT.\n\nWE ALSO HAVE LOTS OF OTHER EVENTS INCLUDING MOVIES\, WALKS\, HIKES
 \, ARTS & CULTURE\, AND RESTAURANTS.\n\nNOTE: Sometimes things happen and 
 I might have to cancel\, so please keep an eye on the event page for updat
 es.\n\nMathew is the organizer for this meetup. If you need to contact him
 \, please post a message on the wall or email him at torontomoviesandoutin
 gs@hotmail.com.\n\n🦫⚽ Fifty-two beavers. One city. Countless photo op
 portunities. Let's see how many we can find! ⚽🦫
